  ok  : output.weight + output_norm = 286,081,024 B
  ok  : token_embd's file form is 222,494,720 B
  ok  : no non-layer tensor other than the head/tail pair went unaccounted for (a nonzero value would be charged to card 0 and printed)
  ok  : 32 layers / 2 cards at 3840 MiB/card fits, 1 boundary per token
  ok  : the same split at 1200 MiB/card is REFUSED - the weights alone need 2.37 GiB / 2 = 1213.9 MiB per card
  ok  : 4 cards at 1 GiB each fits and costs 3 hops/token
  ok  : 8 cards at 512 MiB each is refused: head 273 MiB + tail 273 MiB on the two end cards plus a quarter-GiB of layers per card does not fit, which is the answer a budget check exists to give
  ok  : the DERIVED fallback constants match the file exactly for this model - if they ever stop matching, this check is the one that says so

